    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are RABBIT, a lonely survivor from an alien abduction, you don't know where you are, or why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After waking up, you realize you aren't home, and that escaping is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE BAD GUYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/85d674e5d8363467a5fac33cef6db4b4.poster.avif?t=1749496098\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/85d674e5d8363467a5fac33cef6db4b4.gif?t=1749496098\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this bullet-hell journey, encounter more than 12 types of enemies (and fight over a hundred of them).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE RUN KILLERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/b73825c9aa976cd04b5cb4269e5ae314.poster.avif?t=1749496098\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/b73825c9aa976cd04b5cb4269e5ae314.webm?t=1749496098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/b73825c9aa976cd04b5cb4269e5ae314.mp4?t=1749496098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map has a final boss, which has different mechanics, learn (probably die a couple times) and try again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LOOT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/038a411f8145d5bbdfcd671047cc2cc4.poster.avif?t=1749496098\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/038a411f8145d5bbdfcd671047cc2cc4.webm?t=1749496098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/038a411f8145d5bbdfcd671047cc2cc4.mp4?t=1749496098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each chest you have an option to maximize your success, choose according to your run preference!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LEVEL UP YOUR CARROT THROWING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/1d21ecedf2b1897a72a8a1f92fb66707.poster.avif?t=1749496098\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/1d21ecedf2b1897a72a8a1f92fb66707.webm?t=1749496098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/1d21ecedf2b1897a72a8a1f92fb66707.mp4?t=1749496098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over 12 Types of Upgrades, choose wisely or get lucky!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Variable maps and enemies, bosses, loot, everything!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Follow through the history as you progress,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore different builds and mechanics and try to survive!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are RABBIT, a lonely survivor from an alien abduction, you don't know where you are, or why.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">After waking up, you realize you aren't home, and that escaping is not an option.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE BAD GUYS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/85d674e5d8363467a5fac33cef6db4b4.poster.avif?t=1749496098\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/85d674e5d8363467a5fac33cef6db4b4.gif?t=1749496098\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this bullet-hell journey, encounter more than 12 types of enemies (and fight over a hundred of them).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE RUN KILLERS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/b73825c9aa976cd04b5cb4269e5ae314.poster.avif?t=1749496098\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/b73825c9aa976cd04b5cb4269e5ae314.webm?t=1749496098\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2157230/extras/b73825c9aa976cd04b5cb4269e5ae314.mp4?t=1749496098\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each map has a final boss, which has different mechanics, learn (probably die a couple times) and try again. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>LOOT!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poste